  "description": "Suddenly evicted from his studio apartment, Ma Soori, a young man blessed with breathtakingly beautiful looks but little else, finds himself stranded on the streets. As he sits on the curb, despairing over his bleak future, an eccentric otaku woman named Kang Jiyu approaches him with an unbelievable lifeline. \n\nJiyu offers him a live-in housekeeper position, promising to cover all his meals, provide a room, and pay an astronomical salary. The catch? He just has to fulfill a few of her highly specific \"requests.\" \n\nDesperate, Soori accepts, only to realize his mistake the moment he steps across her threshold. Horrified by her hidden lifestyle, he stammers in shock, \"S-she’s a total pervert!\" Within a single hour, he is already packing his bags to flee. Will Soori manage to survive his chaotic new job, or will Jiyu's bizarre demands drive him back to the streets?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
